INSERT INTO "flood_history" VALUES('UEI-IMD-FL-2013-0131','14-06-2013 00:00','18-06-2013 00:00',5.0,'heavy to very rainfall/flash floods (saraswati,mandakini rivers,its tributaries triggered by very heavy rainfall,lake burst), cloudburst on jun16 &17 jun, massive landslides,avalanches reported at multiple places. ',NULL,'Chamoli, Pithoragarh, Rudra Prayag,Uttar Kashi Kashi','Uttarakhand',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5000.0,NULL,NULL,1000.0,'i) More than thousands of pilgrims of Char Dham on the Gangotri,Yamunotri routes, Hemkund, Roopkunda,tourists/trakers of Valley of flowers stranded. ii) Lakhs of people shifted to safer places. iii) Many roads including state highways, infrastructures, villages washed away/damaged. iv) Many Hydroelectric projects, houses, water schemes, bridges, commercial,residential buildings, hotels, rest houses, shops, temples, telephone towers, vehicles destroyed/ drifted in the floods of rivers. v) Damage to the cash crops especially apple crops reported.    ','IMD',NULL,'47, 53, 54, None',5);
